# Common constraints

- Use **sync** FastAPI and SQLAlchemy until an explicit async migration phase.
- Do not add asyncpg, asyncio SQLAlchemy, or aiosmtplib unless asked.
- Keep the layout flat under `app/`; avoid premature packages/services/repositories.
- Load config via pydantic-settings; never hardcode `DATABASE_URL` in app code.
- Put test env defaults in `pyproject.toml` `[tool.pytest.ini_options].env`, not conftest.
- Do not commit `.env`; keep `.env.example` in sync when env keys change.
- Do not implement payments, multi-provider, waitlist, or AWS wiring unless requested.
